        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Prince Aimone of Savoy-Aosta, Prince Amedeo\n- Roles: Duke of Apulia, 5th Duke of Aosta\n- Organizations: House of Savoy\n- Places: Italy\n- Concepts: claimants to the former Italian throne, headship of the House of Savoy\n\nFacts:\n- Prince Amedeo, 5th Duke of Aosta, was born on 27 September 1943.\n- The House of Savoy ruled Italy from 1861 to 1946.\n- Prince Amedeo, 5th Duke of Aosta, is a claimant to the headship of the House of Savoy.\n- Prince Aimone of Savoy-Aosta, Duke of Apulia, was born on 13 October 1967.\n- Prince Aimone of Savoy-Aosta is the second child and first son of Prince Amedeo, 5th Duke of Aosta.\n- Prince Amedeo, 5th Duke of Aosta, is one of the two claimants to the former throne of Italy.",
